        "content": "<p>myunbin opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14464\">PR #14464</a> from <code>myunbin:add-rules-261001</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Add new mid-end opt rules:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>x - (x &amp; M) ==&gt; x &amp; ~M</code></li>\n<li><code>(x - (y &amp; M)) + y ==&gt; (y &amp; ~M) + x</code></li>\n<li><code>(x + y) - (x &amp; M) ==&gt; (x &amp; ~M) + y</code></li>\n<li><code>((1 &lt;&lt; k) + 1) * y ==&gt; (y &lt;&lt; k) + y</code></li>\n<li><code>(x + C1) - (y + C2) ==&gt; (C1 - C2) + (x - y)</code> and related add/sub forms</li>\n<li><code>uextend(x) == 0 ==&gt; x == 0</code></li>\n<li><code>uextend(x) == uextend(y) ==&gt; x == y</code></li>\n<li><code>(x == y) ^ 1 ==&gt; x != y</code></li>\n<li><code>x &gt;u (x - 1) ==&gt; x != 0</code>, and its dual(<code>&lt;u</code>)</li>\n<li><code>(c ? x : y) + (c ? p : q) ==&gt; c ? (x + p) : (y + q)</code></li>\n<li><code>(c ? C1 : C2) &amp; M ==&gt; c ? (C1 &amp; M) : (C2 &amp; M)</code></li>\n<li><code>(x == 0) ? y : (x + y) ==&gt; y + x</code>, and its dual (<code>!=</code>)</li>\n<li><code>(c ? C1 : C2) &lt;&lt; K ==&gt; c ? (C1 &lt;&lt; K) : (C2 &lt;&lt; K)</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Thanks!</p>\n</blockquote>",
